Provides: polkit-1-auth-agent
Description: Querencia Desktop session dialog, screen lock and polkit agent (alpha)
 Querencia Sitzung provides the session functions of Querencia Desktop,
 a classic desktop in the style of GNOME 2:
  * querencia-sitzung: the dialog "Abmelden, Bildschirm sperren, Neu
    starten, Herunterfahren" (Ctrl+Alt+Delete), the screen lock
    (ext-session-lock, password check through PAM, Ctrl+Alt+L) and the
    idle lock;
  * querencia-polkit-agent: the polkit authentication agent of the
    session (password dialog for administrative actions).
 .
 Both are started by the Querencia session (querencia-session).
 The interface is English with a German translation (gettext).
 .
 Querencia Desktop is developed with AI tools; every change is reviewed
 and accepted by the project owner.
 This is an alpha release.
